#! beatscript 2
#! skip-test: binds a seed of the generator (gen@1), which tests/examples_beatscript.rs checks without; tested in crates/beatscript-api/tests/forms_roles.rs
#! name: rondo of passacaglias
# rondo-of-passacaglias.beatscript: one seed, a rondo whose episodes are a passacaglia (CC0). Original.
# `gen@1 dubstep seed=54876` fills every role: the melody of its drop is the rondo's refrain, and inside the rondo a
# passacaglia takes its bass as the ground and its arp as the line above it. Forms compose: the passacaglia is written into
# the rondo as text, its sections `ep_ground` and `ep_variation` in its own key (G minor, which its seed calls are fitted to).
# What you hear: the refrain in C, mutated on each return; between the returns the ground under cumulative variations, each
# change kept and the next added on top, carried on across the loop; the sea shanty sung twice.
tempo 140

arrange from template(rondo, @shanty_drunken_sailor, refrain=gen@1 dubstep seed=54876 part=melody, episodes=template(passacaglia, ground=gen@1 dubstep seed=54876 part=bass, upper=gen@1 dubstep seed=54876 part=arp))
